@startuml AskMyData_System_Context

title AskMyData - System Context

left to right direction

actor User

rectangle "AskMyData" {

}

database "PostgreSQL" as PostgreSQL

database "CSV / JSON" as Files

database "BigQuery" as BigQuery

database "MongoDB" as MongoDB

cloud "LLM Provider\n(OpenAI, Azure OpenAI,\nAnthropic, Ollama...)" as LLM

User --> AskMyData : Ask questions

AskMyData --> PostgreSQL : Read data

AskMyData --> Files : Read data

AskMyData --> BigQuery : Read data

AskMyData --> MongoDB : Read data

AskMyData --> LLM : Prompt / Response

@enduml